        "demo_actions": false,
        "screenshot": false,
        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~30s",
      "duration_seconds": 30,
      "narrative": "From Teams, I can open the invoice details directly. That deep link takes me into the full record, where I can see the decision, the evidence behind it, and the source documents the agent used. And if I jump into the agent run, this is where the broader system comes into view. We have several specialist agents working together, each connected to the right IQs to review the case and move it forward.",
